CC ============================================================================
CC MISC.AGF -- MonoSearch supplementary materials (vendor data only)
CC ============================================================================
CC Materials the monocentric search needs that are not in the bundled vendor
CC catalogs (SCHOTT, OHARA, HOYA, SUMITA, CDGM). Every entry is taken from a
CC vendor's own published data. No OpticStudio catalog content is included.
CC
CC Catalog version: 1.0  (2026-10-28)
CC Maintainer:      Synapse Optics
CC
CC ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
CC HPFS_7980  Corning HPFS 7980 fused silica (22 C)
CC ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
CC Source: Corning Specialty Materials Product Information Sheet
CC         "HPFS 7979, 7980, 8655 Fused Silica", July 2015 (corning.com).
CC         Three-term Sellmeier coefficients taken directly from the sheet;
CC         max error 2.4e-6 against its 20 tabulated indices, 185-1129 nm.
CC         Entry copied verbatim from the Synapse Optics CORNING_FS.AGF v1.1.
CC
CC F_SILICA is an alias of HPFS_7980 with identical data, so that designs
CC naming the material generically (e.g. the AWARE2 objective in Stamenov,
CC Agurok and Ford, Appl. Opt. 51, 7648 (2012)) resolve. MonoSearch merges
CC same-data aliases into one search entry.
